{"id":"n62315-2-7","stage":3,"title":"떠올리다 · 浮现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62315-2-7-1","ko":"아기가 얼굴에 미소를 떠올리며 자고 있네.","zh":"宝宝正面带微笑地睡着呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼굴에","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미소를","meaning":"微笑","explanation":"미소：微笑；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"미소","audio":"/audio/fa21fb62109ff657223f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59246","senseId":"1","lemma":"미소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떠올리며","meaning":"浮现，泛起","explanation":"떠올리다：浮现，泛起；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"떠올리다","audio":"/audio/aa43681b278285b97136.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62315","senseId":"2","lemma":"떠올리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자고","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있네.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"fa21fb62109ff657","term":"미소","zh":"微笑","audio":"/audio/fa21fb62109ff657223f.mp3","entryId":"59246","definition":"无声地嫣然一笑。","pronunciation":["미소"]},{"id":"aa43681b278285b9","term":"떠올리다","zh":"浮现，泛起","audio":"/audio/aa43681b278285b97136.mp3","entryId":"62315","definition":"脸上露出某种表情。","pronunciation":["떠올리다"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/558b19011467949f891b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62315-2-7-2","ko":"즐거운 꿈이라도 꾸는 모양이지.","zh":"看来是在做美梦吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"즐거운","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꿈이라도","meaning":"梦","explanation":"꿈：梦；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"꿈","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57279","senseId":"1","lemma":"꿈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꾸는","meaning":"做","explanation":"꾸다：做；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"꾸다","audio":"/audio/ea4054f32b1e1745e6a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62352","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모양이지.","meaning":"像，好像","explanation":"모양：像，好像；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"모양","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62398","senseId":"1","lemma":"모양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]},{"id":"30fb5e8ccd7b82b3","term":"꿈","zh":"梦","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3","entryId":"57279","definition":"指睡觉期间有着和清醒时一样的视听感觉的精神现象。","pronunciation":["꿈"]},{"id":"ea4054f32b1e1745","term":"꾸다","zh":"做","audio":"/audio/ea4054f32b1e1745e6a4.mp3","entryId":"62352","definition":"睡觉时在梦中像现实生活一样看、听、感觉。","pronunciation":["꾸다"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"像，好像","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62398","definition":"表示估计或推测。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1d0c91ce8812b32e676.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.8,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62315","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":98,"sequenceScore":2.6267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看来是在做美梦吧。","最近那些年轻歌手的受欢迎程度好像有点虚高啊。","宝宝正面带微笑地睡着呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看来是在做美梦吧。","宝宝正面带微笑地睡着呢。","最近那些年轻歌手的受欢迎程度好像有点虚高啊。"],"answer":0}]}
